parameters.content:
### {{CLINIC_NAME}} - Medical Records Management System (PET WF6)

**🎯 Purpose:** Comprehensive medical records management with data completeness verification and automated documentation

**🚀 Features:**
• **Data Completeness Checks:** Validates pet history forms and staff notes completion
• **Smart Reminders:** Automated SMS for clients and email for staff when documentation is incomplete
• **Medical Records Creation:** Generates complete medical records from visit data
• **Multi-Database Updates:** Updates both dedicated medical records and master appointment hub
• **Client Communication:** Confirms medical record updates via email

**⚡ Workflow Process:**
1. **Triggered by Visit Completion:** Activated by PET WF3 when visits end
2. **Pet History Verification:** Checks if client completed pet history form
3. **Staff Notes Verification:** Waits 1 hour, then checks staff documentation
4. **Medical Record Generation:** Creates comprehensive medical record with all visit details
5. **Database Updates:** Updates medical records system and master appointment hub
6. **Client Notification:** Sends confirmation email about record updates

**📊 Integration Points:**
• Master Appointments: {{MASTER_APPOINTMENTS_SHEET_ID}}
• Medical Records DB: {{MEDICAL_RECORDS_SHEET_ID}}
• Pet History Form: {{PET_HISTORY_FORM_URL}}
• Medical Records System: {{MEDICAL_RECORDS_SYSTEM_URL}}

**⚙️ Configuration:**
• Clinic: {{CLINIC_NAME}}
• Default Veterinarian: {{DEFAULT_VETERINARIAN}}
• Admin Email: {{ADMIN_EMAIL}}
• Business Contact: {{BUSINESS_PHONE_NUMBER}} / {{BUSINESS_EMAIL}}

